===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/truː/|lang=sv}}
* {{audio|Sv-tro.ogg|audio|lang=sv}}

===Etymology 1===
From {{inh|sv|gmq-osw|tro|trō}}, from {{inh|sv|non|trú}}, from {{inh|sv|gem-pro|*trūwō}}

====Noun====
{{sv-noun|c|-}}

# [[faith]], [[belief]]
# {{lb|sv|dated}} [[allegiance]]
#: {{ux|sv|svära konungen '''tro''' och loven|t=swear allegiance to the king}}

=====Declension=====
{{sv-noun-unc-irreg-c|2=tron}}

=====Related terms=====
{{rel3|trofast|trohet|trosfrihet|troslära|trossamfund|lang=sv}}

===Etymology 2===
From {{inh|sv|gmq-osw|troa|trōa}}, {{m|gmq-osw|tro|trōa}}, from {{inh|sv|non|trúa}}, from {{inh|sv|gem-pro|*trūwijaną}}.

====Verb====
{{head|sv|verb}}

# to [[believe]]
#: {{ux|sv|'''tro''' alla om gott|t=think well of everybody}}
#: {{ux|sv|'''tro''' på något|t=[[believe in]] something}}
