# to [[think]]; to consider correct, but being unable to [[prove]] it
#: {{ux|sv|Det har '''trotts''' mycket kring den här utvecklingen, men det har inte varit fastslaget i data vad som verkligen håller på att ske – förrän nu.|t=Much has been thought (speculated) concerning this development, but it hasn't been proven by data what really is happening - until now.}}
# to [[think]]; to consider something correct that is not correct.
#: {{ux|sv|Hon '''trodde''' att Oslo var Danmarks huvudstad|t=She thought that Oslo was the capital of Denmark}}

